====Usage notes====
* {{sense|partial floor covering}} The terms '''''rug''''' and {{m|en|carpet}} are not precise synonyms: a ''rug'' covers part of the floor; a ''carpet'' covers most or a large area of the floor; a ''fitted carpet'' runs wall-to-wall.

